{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 22, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler a Japan itinerary I weave\nA journey grand for thee to believe.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo's Realm**\n\nFrom distant shores thou shalt arrive\nAt Narita's gate where dreams revive.\nA taxi swift a hotel grand\nIn Shinjuku's heights a promised land.\nExplore the streets a bustling sight\nWith neon glow and vibrant light.\nDinner awaits a culinary grace\nRamen's warmth a smiling face.\n\n**Day Two: Tokyo's Ancient Heart**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple we shall roam\nSenso-ji's beauty a sacred home.\nNakamise-dori a market's cheer\nWith trinkets bright and treasures dear.\nThen onward to the Imperial Place\nWhere history sleeps with regal grace.\nGinza's shops a dazzling show\nWhere fortunes bloom and riches grow.\n\n**Day Three: Hakone's Mountain View**\n\nA journey forth to Hakone's keep\nWhere mountains rise and valleys sleep.\nCruise Lake Ashi a mirrored sheen\nWith Fuji's peak a wondrous scene.\nVolcanic hot springs a soothing balm\nTo ease thy cares and keep thee calm.\nArt museums grand a cultural treat\nA peaceful respite bittersweet.\n\n**Day Four: Kyoto's Golden Age**\n\nThe Shinkansen speeds a silver dart\nTo Kyoto's heart a work of art.\nFushimi Inari's gates ascend\nA vermillion path without end.\nKiyomizu-dera's wooden stage\nA panoramic view to engage.\nGion's district geishas glide\nA whispered beauty deep inside.\n\n**Day Five: Kyoto's Zen Gardens**\n\nRyoan-ji's rocks a puzzling view\nA Zen garden's peace for me and you.\nKinkaku-ji's gold a shining grace\nReflecting beauty time cannot erase.\nArashiyama's bamboo grove so tall\nA verdant haven enchanting all.\nA tea ceremony a ritual fine\nA moment held a grace divine.\n\n**Day Six: Nara's Deer and Temples Old**\n\nTo Nara we journey a sight to behold\nWhere friendly deer their stories unfold.\nTodai-ji Temple a giant's might\nHousing Buddha bathed in golden light.\nKasuga Taisha lanterns gleam\nA sacred pathway a waking dream.\nReturn to Kyoto's gentle hold\nStories whispered ages old.\n\n**Day Seven: Departure's Sad Farewell**\n\nA final morn a wistful sigh\nAs Japan's beauty bids goodbye.\nTo Kansai Airport we shall fly\nWith memories held up to the sky.\nThy journey ends thy heart replete\nWith wonders seen both bitter sweet.\nFarewell dear traveler until we meet\nIn dreams of Japan oh so complete.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.011765611357986927}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -1.5393308401107788}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.009858490899205208}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.19266584515571594}, {"token": "▁Japan", "logprob": -0.8559193015098572}, {"token": "▁itinerary", "logprob": -0.6841153502464294}, {"token": "▁I", "logprob": -0.011168700642883778}, {"token": "▁weave", "logprob": -0.5837070941925049}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.2567358613014221}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.07998145371675491}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.18434253334999084}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.7172681093215942}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -1.4907187223434448}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.001773571828380227}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.13088111579418182}, {"token": "▁believe", "logprob": -0.5192230343818665}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.06410977244377136}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.0013309201458469033}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.16064102947711945}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.009545518085360527}, {"token": "▁One", "logprob": -0.4597935080528259}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.41134214401245117}, {"token": "▁Arrival", "logprob": -0.0010271755745634437}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": -0.0003234816831536591}, {"token": "▁Tokyo", "logprob": -0.16048823297023773}, {"token": "'", "logprob": -1.0192534923553467}, {"token": "s", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": "▁Realm", "logprob": -0.2609805464744568}, {"token": "**", "logprob